 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 21,
   "description": "Every morning the Rooting Plague Boars dig up another burial in the Mournfen Blightfields, which lies in the northwest of Mournfen, and I find myself burying old acquaintances again. Kill eight during the day. Some of the disturbed graves have tally marks beside them; even in Mournfen, I do not suspect the boars of bookkeeping.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_steward",
   "giver_name": "Mordec Silt",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Village",
   "id": "mournfen_fen_01",
   "min_level": 9,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 young_boar [in kragmar_mournfen/blightfields]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_mournfen/blightfields",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:young_boar"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stillgrave_departure"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Fen Gives Them Back",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_steward",
   "xp": 320
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Eight Raw Meat, please; I need to render tallow for the vigil candles. Some mourners complain that remembering the departed should not smell quite so much like supper. They still cup their hands around the flame when the draught comes.",
   "giver": "r15_undead_local",
   "giver_name": "Edris Wax",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Village",
   "id": "mournfen_stores_01",
   "min_level": 10,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 8 mobs:meat_raw"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 8,
     "item": "mobs:meat_raw",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "By the Light of Supper",
   "turnin": "r15_undead_local",
   "xp": 200
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "Sera Vane has found the same tally marks among the reeds she watches from Mournfen Outpost. Go there and tell her what you saw in the burial rows. I would like to be mistaken about this, but I have had a very long time to recognise a theft.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_steward",
   "giver_name": "Mordec Silt",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Village",
   "id": "mournfen_fen_02",
   "min_level": 11,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Sera Vane (mournfen_outpost)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r14_undead_scout",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "mournfen_fen_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Marks in the Reeds",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_scout",
   "xp": 85
  },
  {
   "copper": 23,
   "description": "I watched the Reed Mirefolk in Blackreed Enclosure, north from here, settle a day's wages with bones from our barrows. Kill eight of them to disrupt the trade, and watch for Reed Crocodiles around the enclosure. They scratch each payment on a reed for Mirefolk Reed-Counter Silt; apparently robbing the dead requires excellent records.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_scout",
   "giver_name": "Sera Vane",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Outpost",
   "id": "mournfen_watch_01",
   "min_level": 11,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 8 reed_mirefolk [in kragmar_mournfen/blackreed_enclosure]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_mournfen/blackreed_enclosure",
     "count": 8,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:reed_mirefolk"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "mournfen_fen_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Somebody's Grandfather as Wages",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_scout",
   "xp": 405
  },
  {
   "copper": 23,
   "description": "Mourners see the Wandering Wisps over the Mournfen Wispfen, which lies in the west of Mournfen, after dark and think someone has come to guide them home. Put out seven before more people follow them into the water. Go by night; by day you will find Plague Tuskers, whose intentions are at least easy to read.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_scout",
   "giver_name": "Sera Vane",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Outpost",
   "id": "mournfen_watch_02",
   "min_level": 13,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 7 wandering_wisp [in kragmar_mournfen/wispfen]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_mournfen/wispfen",
     "count": 7,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:wandering_wisp"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "mournfen_watch_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Light Can Lie",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_scout",
   "xp": 450
  },
  {
   "copper": 23,
   "description": "The Plague Tuskers in the Mournfen Barrowfields, which lies in the heart of Mournfen, now greet daytime mourners with a charge. Kill seven so we can tend the graves without adding hurriedly to them. Watch for Cairn Sun-Dried Husks among the barrows; I have enough names awaiting entry without yours.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_steward",
   "giver_name": "Mordec Silt",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Village",
   "id": "mournfen_fen_03",
   "min_level": 14,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 7 bristling_boar [in kragmar_mournfen/barrowfields]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "kragmar_mournfen/barrowfields",
     "count": 7,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:bristling_boar"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "mournfen_fen_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Visiting Hours Are Cancelled",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_steward",
   "xp": 473
  },
  {
   "copper": 16,
   "description": "One by one, the lantern hooks along the barrow paths have rusted through. Mine and smelt six Iron Bars for replacements, and bring me four Coal Lumps for the work. I would like the next funeral procession to arrive with the same number of people it set out with.",
   "giver": "r15_undead_local",
   "giver_name": "Edris Wax",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Village",
   "id": "mournfen_stores_02",
   "min_level": 14,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 6 grug_materials:iron_bar",
    "bring 4 default:coal_lump"
