   "title": "A Place in the Book",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_steward",
   "xp": 518
  },
  {
   "copper": 21,
   "description": "The trail of stolen barrow goods ends at the Mournfen Bandit Camp east from here, where the Bandit Lookouts discourage inquiries with arrows. Close the distance and kill six. They are holding Hollis Grey there; I need his account of things, preferably before it requires a medium.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_scout",
   "giver_name": "Sera Vane",
   "giver_settlement": "Mournfen Outpost",
