   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Arrows Over the Evidence",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_scout",
   "xp": 460
  },
  {
   "copper": 31,
   "description": "I counted every sack they carried to the Mournfen Mire Nests east from here; there was precious little else to do from a cage. Mirefolk Reed-Counter Silt counts the bones there and pays the bandits in pearls. Kill five Reed Mirefolk at the nests and the Reed-Counter as well, then take word to Sera Vane at the outpost. I would dearly like my last memory of this place to be of their accounts failing to add up.",
   "giver": "r14_undead_captive",
